/S /P
/E (This project focuses on designing a reliable and efficient network topology using Cisco Packet Tracer 8.2 to establish seamless communication between servers, devices, and interconnected systems. The aim is to create a network infrastructure that supports smooth data exchange, strong connectivity, and improved operational efficiency across various organizational units)
/Alt ()
/Pg 11 0 R
