endobj
339 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The primary objective of this project is to design a robust and scalable network that ensures uninterrupted communication and smooth data exchange across various organizational units. The network aims to integrate wired and wireless devices seamlessly, enabling compatibility and efficient operation within the infrastructure. Additionally, it focuses on implementing reliable data routing and secure sharing mechanisms to facilitate effective collaboration between different departments. By utilizing key components such as routers, switches, and other essential devices, the design seeks to optimize network performance while ensuring scalability to accommodate)
/Alt ()
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
